<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mostly higher in quiet trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 1.11 to 5712.38.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 0.36 to 356.79.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.04.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1297 to 978.</p>
<p>Volume was 296,382,010, compared with 306,352,620 Tuesday.</p>
